s gonna be able to go  somewhere else be a guy who can stuff  the run do a good job with that also  maybe push the pocket from the middle a  little bit he did have three and a half  sacks last season so he's somebody i  think that probably can go elsewhere and  get paid more than he will if he sticks  with the giants mike  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports
 

